OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight heavy rain will clear
OL,6,Feastern areas early, with isolated
OL,7,Fshowers elsewhere. Showers developing
OL,8,Fmore widely through the day, often
OL,9,Fheavy with a risk of thunder in
OL,10,Fplaces. Temperatures around normal.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers easing off with some
OL,13,Flate evening sunshine possible. Clear
OL,14,Fspells overnight, along with light
OL,15,Fwinds, could see some cooler
OL,16,Ftemperatures in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
